artpage\\\", \\\"duckduckgo\\\"], \\\"category\\\": \\\"general\\\"}, {\\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Arizona ace Curt Schilling continued his remarkable postseason with seven superb innings and Luis Gonzalez homered, drove in two runs and scored twice as the\\u00a0...\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"2001 World Series | Baseball Almanac\\\", \\\"link\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.baseball-almanac.com\\/ws\\/yr2001ws.shtml\\\", \\\"engines\\\": [\\\"startpage\\\", \\\"duckduckgo\\\"], \\\"category\\\": \\\"general\\\"}, {\\\"snippet\\\": \\\"The 2001 World Series stood out not only because of the thrills of the full seven-game series, but also because of its participants. The Yankees, playing with heavy hearts for the people of New York affected by the September 11 terrorist attacks earlier in the season, were perhaps for once not viewed as the sport's villain dynasty, but rather as sympathetic figures. The D-backs, meanwhile ...\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"2001 World Series recap - MLB.com\\\", \\\"link\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.mlb.com\\/news\\/2001-world-series-recap\\\", \\\"engines\\\": [\\\"startpage\\\", \\\"duckduckgo\\\"], \\\"category\\\": \\\"general\\\"}, {\\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Apr 20, 2013 ... 2001 WS Gm7: Luis Gonzalez gives the D-backs the World Series title with a walk-off single off Mariano Rivera in the ninth inning.\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Luis Gonzalez gives the D-backs the World Series title - YouTube\\\", \\\"link\\\": \\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=H9eE7fZSUt8\\\", \\\"engines\\\": [\\\"startpage\\\"], \\\"category\\\": \\\"general\\\"}]\",\"additional_kwargs\":{},\"response_metadata\":{},\"type\":\"tool\",\"name\":\"web_search\",\"id\":\"1c21281a-f5d8-4bfe-b70b-b9c4b498f886\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call_ZbVFEx0GvZQhinQ6Ug6sZRlJ\",\"artifact\":null,\"status\":\"success\"},{\"user_id\":\"5c4682c1-7f2e-43e1-9255-254a04eb1e74\",\"thread_id\":\"9bad96e1-b33d-4511-9d52-d2e6b700c181\",\"checkpoint_id\":null,\"assistant_id\":null,\"project_id\":null,\"graph_id\":null,\"cur